title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › The referrer replies
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2053
intro: After a request goes out the referral waits. In the demo one button plays the referrer's answer; Reader reads it and the checklist updates.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the real referrer's answer (fax, e-referral, email or call) is simulated by 'Demo: the referrer replies' or More › 'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply'.
---
start s1 "Referral is Awaiting info\nafter 'Send request'"
screen sc1 "Checklist while waiting\nAsked rows read 'Waiting on the referrer. Asked by email, just now.'\nOnly 'Mark OK' stays on those rows"
wait w1 "Time passes\nThe referral stays Awaiting info"
ext x1 "Referrer answers by fax, e-referral, email or phone\n(demo: simulated)"

group gBtn "The demo button"
  click c1 "Checklist: click 'Demo: the referrer replies'"
  click c2 "Full page: click More › 'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply'"
  decision d1 "Is the referral Awaiting info?"
  toast t1 "'Nothing to answer yet'\n'Use Request information first. The demo reply answers an open request.'"
endgroup

agent a1 "Reader reads the reply and runs the nine checks again"
process p1 "Fixed by the reply: signed order, current dates, a cosigning clinician, an ICD-10 code, missing form parts, level of care, phone number"
decision d2 "Did the referral have no insurance?"
process p2 "An insurance card arrives: Summit Medicaid HMO, member ID …4410\nCoverage has not been checked yet"
decision d3 "Is the patient under 18?"
process p3 "Age is not fixed by a reply\nThe row stays 'Check this' and only 'Mark OK' lifts it"

store st1 "Referral is In review again\nFixed rows read 'Resolved by the referrer's reply'"
process p4 "Timeline: 'Reply received from … by email'\n'Reader read the reply and updated the extracted fields'\n'Validation ran again: 3 findings resolved, 9 of 9 checks passed' (fewer if age failed)"
toast t2 "'The referrer replied'\n'3 findings resolved. RF-2053 is back In review.'"
toast t3 "Bell 'The referrer replied'\n'Crisis line 988 follow-up answered RF-2053. Reader read the reply and 3 findings are resolved.'"
screen sc2 "Checklist after the reply\n'11 of 11 ready', 'Nothing is missing'\n'Run coverage check' is available\n'Accept referral and continue' is enabled (unless the age failed)"
goto g1 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Accept a referral"

s1 --> sc1 --> w1 --> x1
x1 --> c1 --> d1
x1 --> c2 --> d1
d1 -->|No| t1
d1 -->|Yes| a1 --> p1 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| p2 --> d3
d2 -->|No| d3
d3 -->|Yes| p3 --> st1
d3 -->|No| st1
st1 --> p4 --> t2 --> sc2 --> g1
p4 -.-> t3
